  "description": "etwlib is a .NET library that provides raw access to Microsoft Windows Event Tracing (ETW) infrastructure including providers, manifests, and event data. etwlib is meant to be the foundation for larger projects that leverage its capabilities and is distributed as a Nuget package.",
  "id": "etwlib",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-11T23:01:53.15Z",
